Misty: copy the live box mechanism one to one (13 boxes, proof, narration, back office)

All thirteen live box pages were captured on 12 October 2026 and parsed into
src/engine/mistyLive.generated.ts: real names, prices, exact page weights
(sum 100 per box), free-spin tables and the fairness text.

- engine/labs/misty.ts: a dedicated opener that reproduces one open as the
  site describes it (secret committed per open, client seed, nonce,
  HMAC-SHA256 keyed DRAW-slug-seed-client-nonce, 13-hex roll, odds table
  hashed and frozen onto the open, free spins on the next nonces, reveal,
  rotate), a verifier, the per-open maths (cost per outcome, return at face
  and real), per-player tables, and a runner with chi-square and proofs
- new lab id "misty" wired through runLab, worker, runs, report, run detail
- MistyStage: box strip, spin strip, playing-as, Mistee balance, trade-in,
  proof panel with "Check this open", a step-by-step narration of every
  spin and the general logic underneath
- MistyLab: back office behind the cog: odds per outcome with sum and cost
  per open, free-spin table, Mistee face and real value, per-player odds
  (pieces multiplier or row by row), proof on or off, run size
- MistyResults: counts against stated odds, returns, per player, proofs
- operators: Misty's first tab is the copy; the generic view stays as
  "Research view"; skins and guides updated
- scripts/smoke-misty.ts: every box, proofs, tampered seed, VIP table
- README: Misty section

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
